{"id":"3979795456a966f2","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-reduced-product-preservation.md","title":"Preservation under Reduced Products","display":"df-reduced-product-preservation — Preservation under Reduced Products","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-reduced-product-preservation","aliases":["17-df-reduced-product-preservation"],"display":"df-reduced-product-preservation — Preservation under Reduced Products","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","[[17-df-filter]]","[[17-df-reduced-product]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-reduced-product-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-reduced-product-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reduced-product-preservation — Preservation under Reduced Products"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3807ab351b0011c6\" href=\"?note=3807ab351b0011c6\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product\">17-df-reduced-product</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\)</span> (truth in a structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\\)</span> (proper-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"50a46bce013b2772\" href=\"?note=50a46bce013b2772\" title=\"17-df-filter\">17-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\\)</span> (reduced-product predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3807ab351b0011c6\" href=\"?note=3807ab351b0011c6\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product\">17-df-reduced-product</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nL\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall I\\,\\forall D\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\;\\to\\;\n\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L(\\sigma)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\nL\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\n\\forall I\\,\\forall D\\,\\forall(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\,\\forall\\mathfrak B\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},D,\\mathfrak B\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\models\\sigma)\n\\;\\to\\;\n\\mathfrak B\\models\\sigma\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is preservation for arbitrary proper filters. Such filters do not support the full Łoś equivalence for arbitrary sentences; the predicate singles out sentences whose truth is preserved under every reduced product.</li>\n<li>The quantified family is required to consist of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, so the satisfaction clauses are well typed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本次滤子接口修订：此处显式使用真滤子，与既有约化积构造的定义域一致；原书允许不真滤子的广义定义未在本节点采用。原有来源与证明核验限制继续有效。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","he